dsh-git-panel — third-party attribution
=======================================

This package adapts code and design from the dsh-web plugin family
(https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web), package `dsh-git-graph`,
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Files adapted, and how they differ from the original
----------------------------------------------------

lanes.js
  Adapted from `packages/dsh-git-graph/src/core/types.ts` (`computeLanes`).
  The package was changed to build its lane-waiting set from the commits the
  current page actually renders, rather than from every parent any row names,
  so a merge parent past the page edge ends its line at the boundary instead
  of holding a column open to the end of the page. A safety cap on one row's
  gutter was added, which the original does not have.

client.js
  The panel's layout, metrics, and stylesheet follow
  `packages/dsh-git-graph/src/client/graph/GraphDialog.tsx` and its
  `src/client/chips/context.module.css`. The panel adds a working-tree status
  block and an uncommitted-files card, which the original dialog does not
  have, and it renders through the shared `Modal` primitive rather than its
  own backdrop.

